window.products.push({"id":133044,"name":"DC93-00634A Samsung Dryer Idler Pulley Replacement Dv45h7000ew/a2 Dv42h5000ew/a3 Dv42h5200ew/a3 Dv210aew/xaa Dv231aew/xaa Dv330aew/xaa Dv40j3000ew/a2 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61aeRZZvKNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💡 DC93-00634A Samsung Dryer Idler Pulley Replacement - A high-quality exact equivalent for part numbers AP6038887, DC97-07509B, DC61-01230B, DC96-00882B, DC96-00882C, PS11771601. DC93-00634A Dryer Idler Pulley is compatible with Samsung, Kenmore appliances. It fits hundreds of models. The idler is an important component of the dryer’s drum support system. It is responsible for keeping the tension on the drum belt, which allows the drum to rotate smoothly during the drying cycle. 🔧 DIY eTips Included - Not sure how to replace the part? Helpful information can be found on the page below. Scroll down to get more repair tips. Acquire valuable skills during the DIY repair project. DC93-00634A Dryer Idler Assembly will help if your appliance is noisy, doesn't tumble, or doesn't start. Replacing the dryer idler is a straightforward process but requires some basic DIY skills. Before attempting any repairs, it is essential to disconnect the dryer from the power source. 💡 The DC93-00634A Dryer Idler is made of high-quality materials to ensure durability and longevity. It features a sturdy metal construction with a smooth, polished finish. The part also includes a plastic wheel that helps to reduce friction and extend the life of the belt. Duet dryer pulley meets or exceeds all manufacturer specifications. We provide a lifetime warranty and guarantee 100% money back. 💡 How do I know if my idler pulley is bad on my dryer? You can determine if your idler pulley is bad on your dryer by looking for several signs, including squeaking or squealing noises, the drum not turning, the belt slipping or coming off, a burning smell, and visual damage. If you notice any of these signs, it is recommended that you inspect your dryer's idler pulley and replace it if necessary to prevent further damage to the dryer. 💡 Popular Models: 402.89032010, dv209agw, dv210aew/xaa, dv231aew/xaa, dv330aew/xaa, dv40j3000ew/a2, dv42h5000gw/a3, dv42h5200ef/a3, dv42h5200ep/a3, dv42h5200ep/ac, dv42h5200ew, dv42h5200ew/a3, dv42h5200gw/a3, dv45h6300eg/a3, dv45h6300gg/a3, dv45h7000gw/a2, dv45k6200ew/a3, dv45k6500ev/a3, dv45k6500ew/a3, dv48h7400ew/a2, dv48h7400gw/a2, dv48j7700ew/a2, dv48j7770ep/a2, dv50f9a6evw/a2, dv50f9a7evp/a2, dv50f9a7evw/a2, dv50f9a8evp/a2, dv50k8600ev/a3, dv52j8700ep/a2, dv52j8700ew/a2, dv56h9100eg/a2.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61aeRZZvKNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PartsBroz","source_asin":"B0BZ4NZZV3","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-133044","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZ4NZZV3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZ4NZZV3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
