window.products.push({"id":133090,"name":"W11344457 Dryer Heating Element 3387747 - Suitable for Whirlpool Kenmore elite he4/90 series heating element Exact fit medc700vw0, 110.82822101, gew92","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71C7sRg-wML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"𝟑𝟔𝟓 𝑫𝑨𝒀𝑺 𝙒𝘼𝙍𝙍𝘼𝙉𝙏𝙔--- 𝑺𝑼𝑷𝑷𝑶𝑹𝑻𝑺 𝟑𝟔𝟓 𝑫𝑨𝒀𝑺 𝑹𝑬𝑻𝑼𝑹𝑵 𝑨𝑵𝑫 𝑬𝑿𝑪𝑯𝑨𝑵𝑮𝑬. Beaquicy attaches great importance to the shopping experience of each customer. Customer satisfaction is our tireless pursuit. ★【𝟯𝟯𝟴𝟳𝟳𝟰𝟳 𝙃𝙀𝘼𝙏𝙄𝙉𝙂 𝙀𝙇𝙀𝙈𝙀𝙉𝙏】-- WP3387747 Dryer Heating Element Assembly is used in dryers, effectively generates heat in an electric clothes dryer to dry clothes. The package includes 1 x whirlpool dryer heating element W11045584, includes the housing with the heating element coil and insulators attached. The size is about width 5.7 inch × length 13.8 inch. The WP3387747 dryer heating element power is 5400 watts and the voltage is 240 volts. This heating element has 5/16\" terminal ends. ★【𝙃𝙄𝙂𝙃 𝙉𝙄𝘾𝙆𝙀𝙇 𝘾𝙃𝙍𝙊𝙈𝙄𝙐𝙈 𝘾𝙊𝙉𝙏𝙀𝙉𝙏】-- The whirlpool 3387747 dryer element is made of high quality METAL and contains heating wire coils which have the Nickel-chromium content reaches 85% for generating heat effectively in electric dryer. The insulators are made of high-tem-perature ceramic. They are firmlymounted into the frame to hold theheating coil, which will not come looseunder the vibration of a running machine. Kenmore dryer heating element ps11741416 can FIX THE FOLLOWING SYMPTOMS: ①Dryer no heat or not enough heat ②Takes too long to dry ③Too hot ④Will not shut off ⑤Will not start. ★【𝙎𝙐𝙄𝙏𝘼𝘽𝙇𝙀 𝙁𝙊𝙍 𝙈𝙊𝙎𝙏 𝘿𝙍𝙔𝙀𝙍 𝙈𝙊𝘿𝙀𝙇𝙎】-- This W11344457 3387747 heating element assembly can works with models such as 7ewed5550yw0, 7ewed5550yw1, 7mmedx550xw0, 7mmedx550xw1, 7mwed5600bw0, medp475ew0, 36396593200, 36396593400, 11066952690, khev01rss0, gec9858hz0, ygew9200lw0, ygew9200lw2, ycee2760kq0, ycee2760kq1, ycee2760kq2, ycee2790kq1, ycem2760kq0, ycem2760kq1, ycem2760kq2, ycem2760kq3, ycem2760tq0, ycem2760tq1, ycep2760kq0, ycep2760kq1, ycep2760kq2, ygeq9800lw0, ygeq9800lq1, ygeq9800pw0, 11084831300, 11085087400, 11086884100, 11086984800, 11086992800,etc. ★【𝙍𝙀𝙋𝙇𝘼𝘾𝙀𝙈𝙀𝙉𝙏 𝙋𝘼𝙍𝙏 𝙉𝙤. 】-- This W11344457 heating element assembly fits for Amana, Kenmore, Kitchen-Aid, Maytag, Whirlpool dryer. 3387747 Replaces part numbers: 80003, 3387747, W11045584, W11344457, WP3387747VP, 525502, AP6008281, PS11741416, EAP11741416. The heating element is located within a housing at the bottom of the dryer, heating coil is manufactured from an alloy of nickel and chromium. It has a high resistance that prevents itself from breaking and burning out. If you are not sure if your dryer model is suitable, you can contact us to confirm it for you. ★【𝘾𝙊𝙉𝙑𝙀𝙉𝙄𝙀𝙉𝙏 𝙁𝙊𝙍 𝙔𝙊𝙐𝙍 𝙇𝙄𝙁𝙀】-- Installing the W11045584 ap6008281 heating element is very simple. Remember to disconnect the dryer from the power before installation, to complete thismulti-step repair, you'll need 1/4\" nut driver and needle nose pliers. Take photos as needed to ensure properreassembly. First put the newelectric heatingwire into thehousing, fixed by screw, than fix the plug onthe outer end. You also can follow the instructions on YouTube for DIY installation. To confirm that the heating element is faulty, unplug the dryer when the symptom occurs in time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71C7sRg-wML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B083NQB58D","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-133090","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083NQB58D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B083NQB58D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
