window.products.push({"id":133246,"name":"Pour Over Coffee Maker, 2 in 1 Pour Over Coffee Dripper Glass Coffee Maker with Reusable Stainless Steel Coffee Filter and BPA-Free Borosilicate Glass","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XC9X3b9gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BE YOUR OWN BARISTAS - Embrace your inner barista and make cafe-quality coffee at home with our pour over coffee maker set, this manual drip method is the best way to unlock the full range of flavors and aromas from your coffee beans, also the easiest way to enjoy a quick cup of tasty coffee with no hassle. A must have for any coffee lover! REUSABLE STAINLESS STEEL COFFEE FILTER - Stop wasting money on paper filters! This pour over coffee filter is made of high quality 18/10 (316) stainless steel, it is reusable and paperless that can save you money also facilitate environmental protection. Comes with an easy-to-grip silicone handle for preventing burns or heat exposure when manipulating. MAKE COFFEE TASTIER - The cone coffee filter is designed in double layer stainless steel mesh with twilled weave, which allows the oils to pass through easily while keeping any coffee grinds out for smoother taste. Also, it is stainless steel and the hot water is not in contact with any plastic, so the pour over coffee would be fresher than machine coffee. MULTI-USE COFFEE CARAFE - The pour over carafe is made of heat-resistant, BPA-free borosilicate glass. 2.5mm thickness carafe (while others are 1mm) is built for durable and long lasting use, it can be used to store milk, juice, tea or other drinks, also can serve as a nice little display trinket for home decor. EASY TO SHARE&CLEAN- The pour over coffee dripper with 800ml capacity that can make 4 cups of coffee each time, great for sharing with your friends or families. Also, the pour over coffee kit is easy to clean by running water and it is dishwasher safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XC9X3b9gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"E-PRANCE","source_asin":"B074N5BJNH","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-133246","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074N5BJNH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B074N5BJNH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
