window.products.push({"id":133436,"name":"Ice Maker Machine Countertop, 40Lbs/24H Auto Self-Cleaning, 24 pcs Ice Cube in 13 Mins, FREE VILLAGE Portable Compact Ice Cube Maker, With Ice Scoop &","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71J9ZVlKf8S._SL1500_.jpg","description":"24 ICE CUBES IN 13 Mins & 40LBS EVERY 24HRS - FREE VILLAGE’s countertop ice maker machine can produce 24 ice cubes per cycle (every 13 to 18 minutes). That means you can make up to 40 pounds of ice cubes every 24 hours. Best of all, you can adjust the thickness of the ice cubes according to your needs, just enjoy a cold drink whenever you need. LCD & DIGITAL DISPLAY & AUTOMATIC CLEANING - Electronic controls for ease of use. Features an easy-to-read push-button. Timer with up to 8-hour delay. Offers on-time ice production. There are WATER-SHORT and BACKET-FULL indicators.Press the \"TIMER\" button for more than 5 seconds to enter the automatic cleaning function. (Please clean your ice machine regularly) WATER RECYCLING SYSTEM - The countertop ice maker machine holds up to 2.2 liters of water, minimizing how often you need to refill it. When filled, it can produce 5 cycles of ice cubes, making 120 ice cubes! It contains a recycling system, collecting melted water and filtering it to be reused ensuring that no water is wasted. It may sound high-tech, but all you have to do is open the cover of the water reservoir, pour in water, and you are ready to start making delicious ice cubes. EFFICIENT & QUIET COOLING - The portable ice maker countertop is equipped with the most advanced refrigeration technology. We use efficient compressors in order to ensure that your ice maker will produce the highest quality ice cubes. Nice ice makers countertops are equipped with a quick and quiet cooling system. This not only helps you save energy, but also keeps the ice machine cool and ensures a quiet environment. USER-FRIENDLY & 1-YEAR FULL WARRANTY - Freestanding design stainless steel portable ice maker allows versatile placement. Ideal for your home, office, kitchen, bar, or coffee shop. The removable ice basket stores up to 2.2 lbs. of ice at one time.For best results, keep the tabletop ice maker machine upright for at least 24 hours before first using it. And we provide a 1-year full warranty for every customer if they have problems with our ice makers!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71J9ZVlKf8S._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FREE VILLAGE","source_asin":"B08TMKCC91","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-133436","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08TMKCC91","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08TMKCC91","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
