window.products.push({"id":133695,"name":"Xbeauty Ice Maker Machine Countertop, Automatic Self-Cleaning Portable Ice Maker. 26Lbs/24H, 9 Cubes Ready in 6 Minutes, Compact Ice Cube Maker with I","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JnB+aPa+L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"<p>[Portable and practical design] The size of the ice maker machine is only 13.9(D) by 9.5(W) by 13(H) inches and its weight is only 18.26LB; this means this ice maker is portable for parties, daily life, camping, office, barbecue and bars. This ice maker machine can meet your needs. The cover of the product adopts transparent design, and it is convenient for you to check the ice making progress at any time.</p> <p>[Amazing ice making speed] This efficient ice maker can produce an average of nine blocks of ice every six minutes. It can produce 26lbs of ice in a single day, and the ice is shaped like a bullet. This ice maker machine can produce 2 different kinds of ice cubes, The S and L buttons on the ice maker correspond to S and L sizes of ice, different sizes of ice can adapt to different sizes of containers. The surface of the ice is smooth, round, not sharp, there is no safety risks.</p> <p>[Efficient and safe] There are special air vents on the side of the ice maker machine. This design can effectively reduce the heat generated by the motor during the operation of the ice machine to keep the surface temperature low, at the same time, the design of noise reduction inside the vent can significantly reduce the sound of the machine when it is running. The motor of the product is specially designed to ensure the efficient operation of the machine and save electricity.</p> <p>[Practical function] The ice making machine has the function of automatic cleaning, the purpose is to remove the minerals produced by the machine during the ice making process to make the ice cubes purer. The control panel located at the top of the product controls the ice-making function, the size of the ice and will alert you when the water is in shortage or the ice is full. The lower right corner of the product has a piston device for releasing water, which is very convenient.</p> <p>[Customer Service] Free replacement for installation problems, damage and missing parts within 1 year. If any questions, please feel free to contact our customer service team. We are happy to answer any questions from our customers.</p>","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JnB+aPa+L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Xbeauty","source_asin":"B091GLZN9D","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-133695","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091GLZN9D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B091GLZN9D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
