window.products.push({"id":133924,"name":"CAVALIERE 30\" Under Cabinet Stainless Steel Kitchen Range Hood w/Remote Control 472 CFM AP238-PS13-30","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51R-dP3kqaL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"With the CAVALIERE 30w in. Under cabinet range hood you can have your range hood and your cabinets, too. This powerful and compact range hood fits under existing cabinets and will make quick work of clearing smoke. Effective, efficient, and stylish, this under cabinet mounted range hood is made of 19-gauge brushed stainless steel for that commercial kitchen look. Its ultra-quiet dual squirrel cage motor and dishwasher-safe, stainless steel baffle filters do an incredible job at quickly clearing the air. Two dimmable halogen lights and a touch sensitive keypad make it easy to use. Convenience comes from its 30-hour cleaning reminder and programmable power auto shut-off so you can set it and forget it. Additional information: 4 speed levels with timer function. Touch sensitive LCD keypad with blue lighting. Dishwasher-safe stainless steel baffle filters. Airflow: 900 cfm - 2 dimmable 35-watt halogen lights - 30-hour cleaning reminder - 1-15 minute programmable power auto shut-off. About CAVALIERE: CAVALIERE offers a complete stainless steel range hood collection. They blend superior components with the latest technologies to create range hoods that cater to your needs. CAVALIERE has a special understanding of the kitchen environment, ergonomics, aesthetics, and integration within your home or workplace. They specialize in wall-mounted, island, or under cabinet range hoods that make a statement in your kitchen. 19-gauge stainless steel under-cabinet range hood. Ultra-quiet dual squirrel cage motor. Noise levels: Low speed: 46 db., high speed: 69 db. Dishwasher-safe stainless steel baffle filters. 8-inch round duct vent. Dimensions: 30w x 22d x 10h inches. 1-year parts warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51R-dP3kqaL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CAVALIERE","source_asin":"B00400RWBG","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-133924","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00400RWBG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B00400RWBG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
