window.products.push({"id":133928,"name":"Supplying Demand W10326469 67004514 Refrigerator Crisper Drawer Center Slide Rail Replacement","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41fwvttN0ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Alternate part numbers include WPW10326469, AP6019603, W10326469, 12796401, 1796813, 8208326, PS11752912, W10326469N, and WPW10326469VP. Supports the crisper drawer as the drawer slides in and out | If your rail is showing signs or wear or damaged it should be replaced | Fits model specific side-by-side refrigerators It is important to disconnect your appliance from the power supply before servicing. Supplying Demand replacement parts are compatible with Major Brands, but you should always verify fitment with your specific model. We have included a video in the product gallery to help you find your model number and information in the description below. SD products come in Supplying Demand packaging.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41fwvttN0ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Supplying Demand","source_asin":"B0B323TX2X","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-133928","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B323TX2X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B323TX2X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":133929,"name":"Waterdrop MWF Refrigerator Water Filter, Replacement for GE® Smart Water MWF, MWFINT, MWFP, MWFA, GWF, HDX FMG-1, Kenmore 9991, GSE25GSHECSS, WFC1201,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51km9XeUOML._AC_SL1221_.jpg","description":"[Replacement for filter models]: GE MWF, GWF, GWFA, GWF01, GWF06, MWFAP, MWFINT, HWF, HWFA, WMF, Kenmore 46-9991, 469991, 9991, 46 9991, 46-9996, 469996, 9996, 46 9996, PL-100, GF-MWF, WD-F13, EBL7771, CF8, WFC1201, AQF-FF13, RWF0600A, RWF0600AH, PP-RWF0600A, FL-RF13, WS613B, MB-F13, PF8, RWF1060, CWMF031, WSG-1,CLCH102, GE MWF, CW-G1. [Compatible with] GSL25IGXNLS, GSL25JFRFBS, GSL25JFXNLB, GSL25KGREBS, GSL25QGPDBS, GSS22QFMCCC, GSS23HMHECES, GSS23LGTACC, GSS23QSTASS, GSS23WSTASS, GSS25CGHECWW, GSS25GFXJBB, HSS25GFPHWW, PCP23SHMFFBS, PFCS1NFZASS, PFSF6PKXCBB, PFSS2MJYCSS, PFSS6PKXBSS, PFSS9PKYASS, PGCS1NFZASS, PIE23NGTIFKB, PIT23SGRCSV, PSE25KSHEHSS, PSE25KSHSS, PSK25MGSBCCC, PSK25NGNDCCC, PSK27NHSCCCC, PSK29NHWGCWW, PSS26MGPBBB, PSS26MSTDSS, PSS26SGPASS, PSS29NHMBBB, PST26SHRCSS, PZS23KSEBFSS, PZS25KSEBFSS. This Waterdrop refrigerator water filter replacement for GE, despite its affordable price, offers the best - a mix of prior filtration performance and important certifications from the well-known regulatory body in the industry – NSF 42 and NSF 372 certificates. GE is a registered trademark of General Electric Company. GE is used for reference purposes only. [360° comprehensive protection] Be aware of the claimed certification. Our filters are comprehensively certifiedby the NSF 42&372 test from each components to the filter cartridge as a whole, providing you all-round protection from harmful impurities. [Advance filtration process] If you have been looking for a way to reduce harmful impurities from your drinking water, the solution is here. This Waterdrp replacement water filter effectively filters off impurities from your water. [Perfect fit] You can now worry less about water leakages due to unfit or loose replacement refrigerator filters. This Waterdrop refrigerator filter replacement is made from an advanced industrial automation system and a precision measurement technology that ensures that you get the same fit as the original. Moreover, you need no tool to install this refrigerator water filter. Just follow the installation guidelines we have provided, and you will be done in minutes. [Top-notch filter material] Here, you are getting a significant improvement to the less-efficient charcoal filter that relies on coal, wood, walnut shell, and apricot shell to filter water. The filter material in this filter is a 100% Sri Lankan selected coconut shell carbon block, with 2x larger surface area and more micropores. Unlike the cheap and mixed carbon block, the filter material in the Waterdrop refrigerator filter improves the overall taste of your water. [Complimentary month install stickers] You do not have to go the extra mile to monitor your refrigerator filter’s lifespan. This Waterdrop refrigerator filter is shipped with complimentary month install stickers that help track the service life at all times. Now you know when you have exhausted the 300 gallons or 6 months of pure water, depending on the water conditions. [BPA-free and food-grade materials] At Waterdrop, we prioritize your safety. This is why we have used only safe materials in this refrigerator filter, as verified by the NSF 372 certification for lead-free materials. [Purified with love] We believe everyone has the right to drink pure water wherever they are. We are not only about business; we hope to use our technology to benefit more people. A portion of every purchase you make is donated to provide children in water-scarce regions in Africa with clean, pure water.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51km9XeUOML._AC_SL1221_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WATERDROP","source_asin":"B01I3NCJAE","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-133929","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01I3NCJAE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B01I3NCJAE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
